====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# Any of species {{taxfmt|Allium tricoccum|species}} of [[plant]]s related to the [[onion]]; a [[wild leek]].
# {{lb|en|Appalachia|or|obsolete}} A [[promiscuous]] man or woman.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1728|author=[[w:John Dennis (dramatist)|John Dennis]]|title=Remarks on Mr. Pope's Rape of the lock. In several letters to a friend. With a preface, occasion'd by the late Treatise on the profound, and the Dunciad.|location=London|publisher=J. Roberts|page=16
|passage=And yet in the very next ''Canto'' she appears an arrant '''Ramp''' and a Tomrigg;{{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|Appalachia|derogatory}} A [[worthless]] person.

